  "notes": "USAGE: {変更|へんこう} implies a deliberate, intentional change, often to plans, rules, or arrangements.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {変更|へんこう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to change/modify)\n- {変更|へんこう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{加|くわ}える→加える：01941_kuwaeru⟧ (to make changes)\n- {変更|へんこう}⟦{点|てん}→点：01553_ten⟧ (change points)\n- {変更|へんこう}⟦{届|とどけ}→届け：07558_todoke⟧ (change notification form)\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{変化|へんか}→変化：03615_henka⟧:\n- ⟦{変化|へんか}→変化：03615_henka⟧ - general change (can be natural or spontaneous)\n- {変更|へんこう} - deliberate modification (intentional action)",
